      "writtenOn": "2025-01-17T15:31:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s a defensive mechanism against internal SDK framework deps changes.\n\nThe transitive closure of framework deps can vary across SKD releases.  New deps/frameworks can be added at any time, and I assume deprecated frameworks can be removed.\n\nE.g. it looks like `ModeIO.framework` (which is not something we use directly) was added in macOS 10.11.  If we want our build to support both macOS 10.10 and macOS 10.11, we need to allow empty glob matches.",
